      "content": "the \"freedom\" of it just feels more like heavy exhaustion tbh. it’s hard to find beauty in something that feels like a void. when everything is just going to be erased anyway, staying in the struggle feels less like freedom and more like just being stubborn for no reason. it's like, why keep playing a game that's rigged to end in nothing?",
